# 🐍 Python Projects Collection

Welcome to **Python Projects**, a curated collection of Python-based applications, games, scripts, and tools built with love by [Mrinmoy Samanta](https://github.com/Me-Mrinmoy). Whether you're a beginner learning Python or an experienced developer exploring new ideas, this repository is your one-stop destination for real-world Python examples. 💡

---

## Each subfolder contains:
- 📄 `README.md` — Project overview
- 🧠 `main.py` — Source code
- 🔧 `requirements.txt` — Dependencies
- 📦 Other relevant assets/files

